OL,3,GNEWSAMan described as an 'instigator'
OL,4,Ain Ballymena riots jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man described as an "instigator" of
OL,7,Frioting in Ballymena last year has been
OL,8,Fsentenced to two and a half years in
OL,9,Fprison.
OL,11,FBradley Philip Douglas, from Waveney
OL,12,FMews in Ballymena, was handed a
OL,13,Ffive-year sentence at Antrim Crown
OL,14,FCourt on Wednesday and will spend
OL,15,Ftwo-and-a-half years in prison,
OL,16,Ffollowed by a further two-and-a-half
OL,17,Fyears on licence.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
