OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan described as an 'instigator'
OL,4,Ain Ballymena riots jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FJailing Douglas, the judge told the
OL,7,F29-year-old that, given the leading and
OL,8,Fpersistent role he played in the
OL,9,Fdisorder, the sentence would have been
OL,10,Flonger had he not admitted his guilt.
OL,12,FAt an earlier hearing, Douglas pleaded
OL,13,Fguilty to two counts of riot on 10 and
OL,14,F11 June 2025 and one count of burglary
OL,15,Fof a property on Clonavon Terrace.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
